      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-18T22:20:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Voting -1. (As I wrote above) I don\u0027t think we want to disable the capability that something external to DPTF can monitor the temperatures and take safety actions.",
      "parentUuid": "f5269478_7a1b284b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 114,
        "startChar": 3,
